# Shared action (P#17, M6 CallStmt), added for E2 (PLAN_ENTERPRISE_REGRESSION.md): the SSR admin
# console's own login form, mirroring `shared/webv2-login.tflw`'s storefront equivalent one level
# up. `webv2-admin.tflw` (pre-E2) never extracted this itself — it repeats the same 4-line block
# inline 6 times — but E2 adds 7 new files that all need it, so the DRY case is real here even
# though it wasn't retrofitted onto the older file (out of scope for E2's own additions).
#
# Ends on the same real settle signal as the storefront's `login()` — `Log out` only renders once
# the server session round-trips through `GET /` (server.js's `requireAuth` + `currentUser` locals)
# — not just "the click landed".

action adminLogin(email, password)
  open "/login"
  fill form
    | "Email"    | {email}    |
    | "Password" | {password} |
  click button "Log in"
  expect button "Log out" is visible
